[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    48[0m:[38;5;10m[49m deterministic xorshift PRNG, ≥256 cases per row unless noted), and both `.so`s
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    49[0m:[38;5;10m[49m are called through `libloading` with their stdout captured and compared
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    50[0m:[38;5;10m[49m byte-for-byte.
